From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sliva0 <sliva0mk@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:22:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Diameter: Type ISUP-Cause-Location as Unsigned32

3GPP TS 32.299 clause 7.2.80D: 'The ISUP-Cause-Location AVP (AVP code
3423) is of type Unsigned32'; table 7.2.0.1 agrees, as does
ISUP-Cause-Value (3424), already Unsigned32 here. Checked against
V18.0.0.
---
 resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml b/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml
index 56a8586..f7ee2c4 100644
--- a/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml
+++ b/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml
@@ -8602,7 +8602,7 @@
 			<type type-name="OctetString"/>
 		</avp>
 		<avp name="ISUP-Cause-Location" code="3423" mandatory="must" vendor-bit="must" protected="may" may-encrypt="no" vendor-id="TGPP">
-			<type type-name="OctetString"/>
+			<type type-name="Unsigned32"/>
 		</avp>
 		<avp name="ISUP-Cause-Value" code="3424" mandatory="must" vendor-bit="must" protected="may" may-encrypt="no" vendor-id="TGPP">
 			<type type-name="Unsigned32"/>
